    "The host is the source of state. ‘No active pairing’ does not mean a pairing request is pending. This loopback development API does not authenticate the app remotely; advertised capabilities do not grant access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The host is the source of state. ‘No active pairing’ does not mean a pairing request is pending. This loopback development API does not authenticate the app remotely; advertised capabilities do not grant access."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O host é a fonte de estado. ‘Sem pareamento ativo’ não indica um pedido de pareamento pendente. Esta API loopback de desenvolvimento não autentica o app remotamente; capacidades anunciadas não concedem grants."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host is unavailable. Your text has been kept; review the connection before retrying.": {
